The '''Red House''' is a sub-[[Location]] of the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}} within the {{Zone|North Wetlands}}.

== Features ==
The '''Red House''' is the home of {{NPCSprite|Coral}}, who collects members of [[The Fish Family]] in exchange for [[SkyBlock Levels|SkyBlock XP]] and {{Stat|respiration}}.

